<title>USA: Philip Morris has no plans on cigars in U.S.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris has no plans on cigars in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Morris Cos Inc's Philip Morris USA unit said it has no plans to market cigars in the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no immediate plans to market cigars,&quot; a Philip Morris USA spokeswoman. &quot;We continue to do so overseas.&quot;</p>
<p>The Chicago Tribune reported on Wednesday that the company has begun research and development on a line of cigars that could be marketed in the U.S. in six to nine months.</p>
<p>&quot;There's no research and development going on now,&quot; the spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
